in like 2015 to 2016.

00:03:31.067 --> 00:03:32.801
-Yeah.
You were there in 2014.

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:34.434
-'14 or '15.
Like it was --

00:03:34.434 --> 00:03:36.734
It was definitely befo--
It was before that guy,

00:03:36.734 --> 00:03:38.534
you know,
made her pies go viral.

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:40.534
He sang an ode to them.

00:03:40.534 --> 00:03:42.734
-She had to make the recipe.
-We have to be unanimous.

00:03:42.734 --> 00:03:44.501
We have to be
unanimous on this.

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:45.567
-Oh. We do?
-Yeah.

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:46.634
-Oh. Well...
-We're partners.

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:47.667
-Okay, whatever you say.

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:49.367
Can you tell
I'm not competitive?

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:51.634
-It was in --
It was in Telluride, Colorado.

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:53.033
-Telluride?
-Yep.

00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:55.300
-Yeah. We didn't ask that,
but thank you for the detail.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.968
Uh, now, I don't know.
Come on.

00:03:57.968 --> 00:04:00.534
-I say yes. I say he's --
I say he's truthful.

00:04:00.534 --> 00:04:02.167
-I got to go with
one of my favorite,

00:04:02.167 --> 00:04:04.000
uh, actors of all time,
Jodie Foster.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.734
I'm gonna say that you --
He's already laughing.

00:04:06.734 --> 00:04:08.534
You tell the tru--
You tell the truth.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:09.901
-It's a lie!

00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:12.434
-Oh, my -- Jodie!

00:04:12.434 --> 00:04:15.434
Come on!
Come on!

00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:17.267
'Course it's a lie!

00:04:17.267 --> 00:04:19.834
Talking -- Patti LaBelle's pies
didn't come out till later on!

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:22.000
