00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:39.634
-One.
-One for me.

00:04:39.634 --> 00:04:40.734
-One!
-One!

00:04:40.801 --> 00:04:41.968
-One!
-One!

00:04:41.968 --> 00:04:44.834
-Two!
-Okay.

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:47.501
