00:05:15.334 --> 00:05:16.834
I'm a big Nicolas Cage fan.

00:05:16.834 --> 00:05:20.701
So I talked to him all night,
and he kept calling me "Jimbo."

00:05:20.701 --> 00:05:22.567
"Jimbo!"
-And so we're leaving,

00:05:22.567 --> 00:05:25.067
