00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:29.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.400
I don't know if they were there
for Nicolas Cage.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.267
Anyway, he goes -- I go,
"I don't have a ride home,"

00:05:32.267 --> 00:05:34.601
'cause I took a cab there.
This is back before Uber.

00:05:34.601 --> 00:05:36.033
-Okay.
-so he goes,

00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:38.601
