on my couch.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.634
-Interesting.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.634 --> 00:06:12.834
-Chateau is on Sunset.
-Right.

00:06:12.834 --> 00:06:14.334
-So...
-Yes.

00:06:14.334 --> 00:06:15.634
