00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.300
When --
When did this take place?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.267
-Uh, when?
I would say 2000.

00:06:39.267 --> 00:06:40.701
I don't think I did
any movies or anything.

00:06:40.701 --> 00:06:44.000
