I was in my 20s.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.267
-Fincher's house.
Okay, 2001.

00:06:47.267 --> 00:06:48.334
-So I did --
-Fincher's house.

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:50.167
He was super fun.
