-Yeah. Stage thing. I mean --

00:09:13.434 --> 00:09:16.267
-Who else was in attendance?

00:09:16.267 --> 00:09:18.834
-I don't remember.
-Uh...

00:09:18.834 --> 00:09:20.467
-Did you --
-There was one other person,

00:09:20.467 --> 00:09:21.934
but I just don't remember
who they were.

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:23.767
-Uh, around what age?
-They were horrified.

00:09:23.767 --> 00:09:26.434
-I was 13.
-13. Okay.

00:09:26.434 --> 00:09:28.167
And then
you went home after that?

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:31.300
I went back to the hotel.
And then I felt better.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.400
I know.
-Yeah, it's interesting,

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.701
'cause where the studio is
and the hotel,

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:39.067
that doesn't make sense.
I've been there before.

00:09:39.067 --> 00:09:40.901
-Okay. Okay.

00:09:40.901 --> 00:09:43.801
-Uh, I don't know.
-And it was all in French.

00:09:43.801 --> 00:09:46.534
-Oh.
-The whole film was in French?

00:09:46.534 --> 00:09:48.167
-The dubbing/looping
was in French.

00:09:48.167 --> 00:09:49.567
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah.

00:09:49.567 --> 00:09:51.100
-You think that's --
-The vomiting was in French.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.234 --> 00:09:54.167
-You're a method --
You're a method vomiter?

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:55.934
-Yes.
-Are you fluent in French?

00:09:55.934 --> 00:09:57.534
-I am.
-Can you say something?

00:09:57.534 --> 00:10:00.367
Like, could you --
Like, continue in French.

00:10:00.367 --> 00:10:04.934
-Uh...
[ Speaking French ]

00:10:04.934 --> 00:10:06.601
-That's Portuguese.

00:10:06.601 --> 00:10:08.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:08.601 --> 00:10:10.234
Man, yeah, I think --
I don't know.

00:10:10.234 --> 00:10:12.000
-I gotta say...
-I think it's believable.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.501
-I think it's totally
believable.

00:10:13.501 --> 00:10:15.667
Yeah. I say you tell the truth.
-You're telling the truth.

00:10:15.667 --> 00:10:16.834
♪♪

00:10:16.834 --> 00:10:19.000
-C'est la vérité.
It is true.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.501
-Yeah!
[ Laughs ]

00:10:20.501 --> 00:10:22.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:22.067 --> 00:10:25.400
Have you seen
the director since?

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.200
-Unfortunately,
he's passed away.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.501
-He passed away.
-He passed away.

00:10:28.501 --> 00:10:30.400
-Oh, my God.
-Well, I mean, he was like 90,

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.234
but so it's okay.
-Were you so embarrassed?

00:10:32.234 --> 00:10:33.434
You're like, "Oh, my gosh.
I'm never gonna work --"

00:10:33.434 --> 00:10:35.801
-That was just
the most horrible thing I --

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:37.901
Because I was about
to say something to him.

00:10:37.901 --> 00:10:41.234
I was saying,
"Oh, I really have to --"

00:10:41.234 --> 00:10:43.734
And then I threw up
all over his face.

00:10:43.734 --> 00:10:46.000
-Oh, God!
I'm so happy.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.033
Thank you so much for playing
this game with us tonight.

00:10:48.033 --> 00:10:50.334
Jodie Foster.
Tariq Trotter.

00:10:50.334 --> 00:10:51.901
We're talking to Jodie
after the break!

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:53.133
Stick around, everybody!

